Author: Suhas N Bhargav <sbhargav@qti.qualcomm.com>
Date:   Fri Jul 5 17:21:37 2024 +0530

    openwrt-patches: nftables Userspace utility to enable Network Prefix Translation(NPTv6)

    The openwrt patch helps us to enable the nft targets to perform
    SNPT and DNPT operations which is RFC-6296 compliant

    Change-Id: I95fa95895f2252f25cd6e47a174fb77edecd2145
    Signed-off-by: Suhas N Bhargav <sbhargav@qti.qualcomm.com>
---
